          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Grak",
            type: "Wraith",
            side: 3,
            x: 21,
            y: 6,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Grak",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:unit_overlay",
            id: "Grak,Zur",
            image: "misc/loyal-icon.png~GS()",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Kaleh, wake up! Sentries report movement in the sands!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Orcs?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("I don’t..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Azkotep",
            text: _("We meet again, Ystara."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ystara",
            text: _("You think you can take me, Azkotep?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Azkotep",
            text: _("My champion, Zur shall slice you to shreds like the puny adept you once were."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ystara",
            text: _("You always were an arrogant little bastard. Grak will swallow your soul, or what’s left of it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Azkotep",
            text: _("You spurned me once and I will make you pay. To battle, my minions! Become my wrath!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("... think so. You really know how to pick a campsite, Kaleh."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Where did they come from? I swear those castles weren’t there at sunset."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("Many strange things can happen during the long dark. But despite their wraith-like forms, I have no doubt that their cold steel can still bite flesh."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Elyssa",
            text: _("Like I haven’t killed enough undead recently. Why can’t these creeps just stay dead?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garak",
            text: _("Our encampment is out of the direct line of attack, so we should be somewhat safe, at least."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("But if the battle spills around our people will be slaughtered by the undead hordes!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("There’s no way we can escape the battle in time. We must protect the camp from the undead."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("I fear that if we lose more than half of the tents we will not have the strength to go on. Garak, wake your men. We must hold off the undead until dawn."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("To arms my people, to arms!"),
          },
        ],
      },
