            speaker: "Nym",
            portrait: "portraits/nym_moody.webp",
            text: _("They’re raising the corpses of our fallen! What a horrible fate!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Elyssa",
            text: _("Then we shall have to give them a proper cremation."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_8",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
