      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_59",
        on: "garak_eulogy",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("From the sands he came, to the sands he will return. We remember and honor his sacrifice, and I vow that his death will not be in vain."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("Goodbye, old friend. May Eloh shine her light eternal upon you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Elyssa",
            text: _("He was as brave and valiant a fighter as I have ever seen in my travels."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            portrait: "portraits/nym_moody.webp",
            text: _("He was a bastard at times... But... but why did he have to die? It... it just doesn’t make sense."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_61",
        on: "branch_if_61",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "elven_camps",
            equals: 12,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("Miraculously, all of our encampments survived the night."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("Though we saved almost all our people this time, we won’t always be so lucky. While elves who have fought with you in the past will gladly return, if the numbers of our people dwindle, it’s going to become more and more costly to recruit new warriors. It would be wise to stockpile gold against this eventuality."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
